    {
      "uid": "zhcn:532047d4a0227ed47227f70c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇的梦想是推广风水，\n让大家获得幸福。为了实现这个目的，\n她必须先自己展现风水的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e9af12c285fc546a67e2c86105c32157cd37dc25ad98e716945ad25dac0e541",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098400.json",
      "json_path": [
