      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙土的前一个世代，\n有北港火山和奇锐骏这两名选手。\n小林历奇将来应该会与她们展开对决吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "687090fadec766815cfcbd726c270c97ed0352dacf000d2915e9e73883f3683e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
