      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在还有人认为风水是玄学。\n努力跑出好成绩，实现梦想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dafca96431bacc51b69ac1998a44352707b194b04914e7438f7a699ab6ac48a2",
