      "uid": "zhcn:3e2090cae1dfed567cd7b56c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇开始寻找\n“愿意协助自己的赛马娘”，\n并依靠幸运色“黑色”找到了北部玄驹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afa6742e14a4e4a21435f0d02c1fa9a181a240382d84268fa05049f50593c9b9",
