    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41e810172849e58ff04d357",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她和小林历奇是曾在同一座公园玩耍的\n儿时玩伴。之后里见光钻也加入成为一员，\n三人一起切磋琢磨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae35037ab934484ec28f59bae2cc419d4a7b803c954049e04e264e7ca4525267",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
