      "uid": "zhcn:3bfdd711732683fd19e3bc5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，小林历奇看见了\n要离开特雷森学园的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67407eea07fc3622c4a9810b762941a0bcc959d8e508f864764e8ca8a58e3241",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1098/storytimeline_501098401.json",
