    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6025676e184fa61ef7f795e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不想再看到赛马娘受挫退出……希望能用\n风水多帮助一些人。小林历奇怀着\n这份温柔的决心，追求力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f1fc5dc19d3437665c9d3d8f985a436d8d5e090fb36f085721c21ce524b533",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
