      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山是因为想帮助故乡的决心才选择\n跑沙土。她将是否能在不起眼的沙土赛中成长，\n与故乡的发展重叠在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51466efc9eae1bcc40deadf7a8cc8ce5c78b8c21697017f5522c708f38b3e335",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
