      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而沙土的大前辈──醒目飞鹰则是\n为了自己身为赛马娘偶像的梦想，\n才选择跑沙土。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0d2a471e646131aae7ddc56e042098f7dcb124ee870a03693529eda3cf6582",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
